Z||000016||gladiator||09-08-2001||11:18 PM||||See you guys at Mickey D's in the morning. I'll try to be there by 7 and I've got a couple of walkie-talkies if we need them. One final thought: It looks like the easiest way to get there is to take I-294 which is a toll road. There are at least two toll booths before we have to exit and there may be one at the exit as well. The last time I was in Chicago, the tolls were 40 cents each so don't forget to bring some spare change. ||||reg||1
